{"id": "EUVD-2026-83638", "enisaUuid": "3d8d66f3-534a-3471-bf3b-21e6948b5123", "description": "Suricata before 8.0.7 has a DoH2 type confusion that can cause an invalid free, because cleanup code for the HTTP2 state is executed even though the actual state is HTTP1 (when there is a DoH2 request with an HTTP1 to HTTP2 upgrade). This requires app-layer.protocols.doh2 to be enabled, which is the default in 8.x versions.", "datePublished": "2026-09-20T01:18:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-22T15:20:03", "baseScore": 9.4, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:L", "references": ["https://forum.suricata.io/t/suricata-8-0-7-released/6467", "https://github.com/OISF/suricata/commit/e574009add9c208f319e1d9d15b3bb1229c88074", "https://github.com/OISF/suricata/compare/suricata-8.0.6...suricata-8.0.7"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-94083", "GHSA-4wwf-734g-mqm8"], "assigner": "mitre", "epss": 0.54, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2f8b502a-4fa9-3e72-9e6c-e662cad68475", "product": {"name": "suricata", "vendor": {"name": "OISF"}}, "product_version": "8.0.0 <8.0.7"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9f4d1e2e-e929-3b16-a4d4-d166b66dda05", "vendor": {"name": "OISF"}}], "isExploited": false}